al\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F3864\">Your Company</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F3864\">Your Company Tagline Here</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F3864\">O (555) 010-0100 | M (555) 010-0101</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F3864\">100 Main Street, Anytown, ST 00000</span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;color:#1F3864\"><a href=\"https://www.yourcompany.com\">www.yourcompany.com</a></span><o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #E1E1E1 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0in 0in 0in\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><b>From:</b> Drew Kessler &lt;drew@kesslerlowe.example&gt;<br>\n<b>Sent:</b> Friday, November 6, 2026 1:55 PM<br>\n<b>To:</b> Pat Staffer &lt;pat@yourcompany.com&gt;<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> Summary for Monday<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Pat,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Summary of the two listings we discussed is below. Happy to walk through both on Monday.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Unit A: 2019 build, one owner, full service records, asking low sevens.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Unit B: 2021 build, warranty through next year, seller motivated.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks,<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\"><img widt